<section class="section grid offer-section" aria-labelledby="help-h">
  <h2 id="help-h" class="rail eyebrow strong">Where I help</h2>
  <ol class="span-wide offers">
    <li class="offer">
      <h3 class="offer-title serif">Launching something new</h3>
      <p class="offer-text">A product, a venture, a new office or a new line of business. I help shape the idea, find the smallest version worth building, and get it in front of the people it’s for.</p>
      <p class="offer-proof">I’ve done this at <a href="/stories/launching-new-ventures-at-aol/" class="ul">AOL</a>, where I helped launch AOL Industry from zero, at <a href="/stories/bringing-north-kingdom-to-the-us/" class="ul">North Kingdom</a>, opening its US operation, and with <a href="/stories/wildebeest/" class="ul">Wildebeest</a>, the studio I co-founded.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="offer">
      <h3 class="offer-title serif">Solving tough problems with software</h3>
      <p class="offer-text">When a process is slow, a team is stuck or AI keeps coming up without a plan, I help find the real problem and build the tool or practice that fixes it.</p>
      <p class="offer-proof">At <a href="/stories/building-the-next-chapter-of-thoughtbot/" class="ul">thoughtbot</a>, I’ve reshaped how a consultancy grows and delivers, and I build <a href="/writing/building-tools-for-my-team/" class="ul">tools for my own team</a> to test what AI can really do.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="offer">
      <h3 class="offer-title serif">Bringing ideas into physical spaces</h3>
      <p class="offer-text">Some of the best ideas happen in person. Events, community programs and places people gather need the same care as any product.</p>
      <p class="offer-proof">I built <a href="/stories/why-leave-astoria/" class="ul">a neighborhood network</a> with more than 10,000 members, and in <a href="/stories/produce-movie-nights-and-a-cleanup/" class="ul">Ladera Heights</a> I’ve run produce pickups, drive-in movie nights and a monthly cleanup.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="section grid offer-section" aria-labelledby="how-h">
  <h2 id="how-h" class="rail eyebrow strong">How it starts</h2>
  <ol class="span-main steps">
    <li><span class="step-n">1</span><span><strong>You tell me about it.</strong> What you’re trying to do, where you’re stuck, and your timing. A few sentences is plenty.</span></li>
    <li><span class="step-n">2</span><span><strong>We talk.</strong> A conversation to understand the idea and the people it’s for, and to see if I’m the right fit.</span></li>
    <li><span class="step-n">3</span><span><strong>We decide the next step together.</strong> That might be a short piece of advice, a focused project, or an introduction to someone better suited.</span></li>
  </ol>
</section>

